@kahowell reports seeing json log lines with a prefix like this:

```
(APIServer pid=1) {"message": "Reloading SSL certificate chain"}
```

This is with `pythonjsonlogger.jsonlogger.JsonFormatter`. I guess it's because `decorate_logs()` monkey-patches `sys.stdout.write` and `sys.stderr.write` and so you see this prefix irrespective of the formatter. This is probably what motivated #28582 and other similar PRs

